│                          │ construction. It preserves every original value with object dtype, supports mixed values  │
│                          │ and missing values using evaluator-compatible serialization, honors merge/dependency      │
│                          │ ordering constraints, evaluates a small set of complete ordering candidates using         │
│                          │ sorted-string LCP reuse, and returns matching per-row column orderings.                   │
